{"steamAppId":363110,"description":"Nobunaga’s Ambition, a series synonymous with Historical Simulation Games, has now released an extension of the 13th release in that series, Nobunaga’s Ambition: Tendou, at the Steam Store as Nobunaga’s Ambition: Tendou w/Power-up Kit!\n\nOn a beautiful 3D map of Japan, players not only fight over castles, but also find a new strategical element in fighting to whittle down their opponent’s territory. For the power-up kit, we have added a new element, “Culture,” that expands the depths of the game’s strategies. Battles become deeper, more brilliant and more exciting.\n\nThe popular edit mode has been upgraded. \n\nAnd with the AI Editor, a series first, you can even adjust how the computer itself thinks.","short_description":"Nobunaga’s Ambition, a series synonymous with Historical Simulation Games, has now released an extension of the 13th release in that series, Nobunaga’s Ambition: Tendou, at the Steam Store as Nobunaga’s Ambition: Tendou w/Power-up Kit!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/363110/header.jpg?t=1729048549","developer":"KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD.","publisher":"KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD.","genre":"Стратегии","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":68,"releaseLabel":"25 июн. 2015 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":82,"steamReviewCount":240,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/363110/ss_c00ed0d0cdfe2ba333465d3665ed688e4e0cc8ed.600x338.jpg?t=1729048549","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/363110/ss_c00ed0d0cdfe2ba333465d3665ed688e4e0cc8ed.1920x1080.jpg?t=1729048549"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/363110/ss_81a6c21b20203ed63fe0ebba7df0b0608977bbd1.600x338.jpg?t=1729048549","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/363110/ss_81a6c21b2020